.TH xml_path 3
.SH NAME
xml_path \- generate the path of an XML node
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "xml.h"
.PP
.BI "int xml_path(const xmlnode *" node ", stralloc *" out ");"
.PP
.BI "int xml_path_relative(const xmlnode *" node ", stralloc *" out ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xml_path
generates the full path of the given
.I node
from the document root and stores it in
.IR out .
.B xml_path_relative
generates a relative path for the node. Returns 1 on success, 0 on error.